      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Global OFAC, UN, EU Sanctions & PEP Watchlist AML Screener Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nScreens individuals, companies, and crypto/banking counterparties against consolidated OFAC SDN, UN Security Council, EU Financial Sanctions, and Politically Exposed Persons (PEP) watchlists. Computes fuzzy similarity and AML Risk Scores (0-100).\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/global-sanctions-pep-interpol-watchlist-screener](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/global-sanctions-pep-interpol-watchlist-screener)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: global-sanctions-pep-interpol-watchlist-screener** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "08f80ff0-041e-52b0-a709-11b4044e33a1",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
